BACKPORT: 3 real-defect fixes for emergent-v3 (EC2 + Cloudflare prod)
=========================================================================
From the code-review triage (fix-real-red-only). Verified with
`git apply --check` against origin/emergent-v3 @ 28e749c2 (2026-07-20,
i.e. AFTER the earlier 5-fix backport was pushed). Backend-only; contains
ONLY these 3 fixes — no migration-specific changes.

  1. backend/routes/ai_wallet.py      — restore the MISSING @router.put
                                        decorator + function signature for
                                        PUT /api/ai-wallet/provider-consent
                                        (endpoint body existed as unreachable
                                        orphan code; frontend calls it from
                                        aiErrors.ts and Step7.tsx and was
                                        silently getting 405)
  2. backend/routes/ai_tools.py       — except clause referenced undefined
                                        name `ai_wallet` (local import is
                                        `_aw`): credit exhaustion in
                                        prioritize-factors raised NameError
                                        -> 500 instead of the intended 402
  3. backend/routes/financial_model.py — add missing `import logging`
                                        (Zoho-snapshot failure path raised
                                        NameError -> 500 instead of the
                                        intended graceful degrade)

HOW TO APPLY (on your machine / EC2 checkout):
  git checkout emergent-v3
  git pull origin emergent-v3
  # get the patch from the e3 branch (it lives at the repo root there):
  git show origin/emergent-v3-e3:backport_3defects_for_emergent-v3.patch > /tmp/backport_3defects.patch
  git apply --check /tmp/backport_3defects.patch    # dry-run, must be silent
  git apply /tmp/backport_3defects.patch
  git add backend/routes/ai_wallet.py backend/routes/ai_tools.py backend/routes/financial_model.py
  git commit -m "fix: restore provider-consent PUT endpoint, 402 on credit exhaustion, financial_model logging import (backport)"
  git push origin emergent-v3

THEN DEPLOY (backend-only change):
  ssh EC2 && cd /opt/dezider && ./deploy/sync.sh
  (No Cloudflare/frontend build needed — all 3 fixes are backend.)

